      ],
      "transcript": [
        {
          "message_id": "post_course_1",
          "post_id": "post_course_1",
          "parent_id": null,
          "kind": "post",
          "author_id": "u_a",
          "author_name": "同学A",
          "created_at": "2026-03-01T09:00:00+08:00",
          "text": "我以后可能保研，也想留一点时间做项目，选课时应该优先看什么？",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "title": "大二方向课到底怎么选",
          "tags": [
            "选课",
            "软件工程"
          ],
          "role": "root_context"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "c_course_1",
          "post_id": "post_course_1",
          "parent_id": "post_course_1",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_lin",
          "author_name": "林学长",
          "created_at": "2026-03-01T10:00:00+08:00",
          "text": "先别按课程名字选。先确认你是保研、就业还是探索方向，再把本学期核心课和每周能投入的时间列出来。保研优先看成绩稳定性，想做项目再留一门项目型课。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "target"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "r_course_1",
          "post_id": "post_course_1",
          "parent_id": "c_course_1",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_a",
          "author_name": "同学A",
          "created_at": "2026-03-01T10:20:00+08:00",
          "text": "我这学期已有四门考试课，每周最多再拿五小时。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "response_to_target"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "r_course_2",
          "post_id": "post_course_1",
          "parent_id": "r_course_1",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_lin",
          "author_name": "林学长",
          "created_at": "2026-03-01T10:40:00+08:00",
          "text": "这种情况下最多加一门项目型课。先向上届同学确认平时作业和组队要求；如果每周稳定超过五小时，就换成考核更确定的课程。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "target"
        }
      ],
      "context_quality": {
