      "transcript": [
        {
          "message_id": "post_course_3",
          "post_id": "post_course_3",
          "parent_id": null,
          "kind": "post",
          "author_id": "u_c",
          "author_name": "同学C",
          "created_at": "2026-05-10T14:00:00+08:00",
          "text": "大二下想为后端实习做准备，两门课时间冲突。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "title": "准备找工作，选理论课还是项目课",
          "tags": [
            "选课",
            "求职"
          ],
          "role": "root_context"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "c_course_3",
          "post_id": "post_course_3",
          "parent_id": "post_course_3",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_lin",
          "author_name": "林学长",
          "created_at": "2026-05-10T14:30:00+08:00",
          "text": "先看你现在缺的是基础还是可展示经历。如果数据结构和数据库还不扎实，优先补基础；基础已经够用但简历没有项目，再选能产出代码和报告的项目课。最后要形成一张表：课程、每周负担、产出、和目标的关系。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "target"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "r_course_4",
          "post_id": "post_course_3",
          "parent_id": "c_course_3",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_c",
          "author_name": "同学C",
          "created_at": "2026-05-10T15:00:00+08:00",
          "text": "如果培养方案下学期变化呢？",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "response_to_target"
        },
        {
          "message_id": "r_course_5",
          "post_id": "post_course_3",
          "parent_id": "r_course_4",
          "kind": "reply",
          "author_id": "u_lin",
          "author_name": "林学长",
          "created_at": "2026-05-10T15:15:00+08:00",
          "text": "培养方案、开课老师和考核方式都要以当年教务通知为准。我只能给选择方法，不能替你确认下学期一定开哪门课。",
          "deleted": false,
          "sensitivity": [],
          "role": "target"
        }
      ],
